  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Denmark&#x2019;s contribution to DanChurchAid project &#x201c;Responsible Business Conduct in East Africa&#x201d;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;Responsible business conduct in East Africa: Strengthening a multi-stakeholder approach to the UN Guiding Principles on Business and Human Rights in Ethiopia and Uganda&quot; is a two-year project with an aim to strengthen multi-stakeholder approaches to the implementation and monitoring of the UNGPs in Uganda and Ethiopia through development of CSO capacity and establish a good practice model for meaningful participation of local right-holders and CSOs in UNGP implementation and monitoring.</narrative>
  </description>
